In order to eliminate the Black Dogs once and for all, we are preparing for a full assault on their main Titan base. The Black Dogs have heavily fortified the canyons rims as well as mining the canyon floors. We are counting on you to clear a path through the canyons to their base. Once we have an open and safe route, we will march into their base with the full might of our mobile assault turrets and destroy them for good.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Clear a path to the Black Dog Base.
- Destroy the base.